    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to bring to the market 163 Biscayne, an attractive four-bedroom semi-detached home situated in a mature and well-established residential area on the coast.\r\n\r\nThis spacious property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and provides an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home in a convenient coastal location.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, the dual-aspect living/dining room provides a bright and welcoming reception space, with patio doors opening directly onto the mature private west-facing rear garden. The garden features both a patio area and lawn, making it ideal for outdoor entertaining or simply relaxing in a private setting.\r\n\r\nA separate modern fully fitted kitchen is positioned to the rear and benefits from integrated appliances. To the front of the property is a versatile office/study room, ideal for those working from home, along with a convenient downstairs WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four generous bedrooms, including a well-proportioned main bedroom with its own dressing room. A family bathroom completes the accommodation at first-floor level.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a cobble-lock driveway to the front, providing off-street parking, while the mature west-facing rear garden offers excellent privacy.\r\n\r\nLocated within a popular and established coastal residential area, 163 Biscayne is conveniently positioned for a host of local amenities, schools, transport links and the coastline. The property combines generous accommodation, private outdoor space and a highly desirable setting.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this lovely property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation : \r\n\r\nFoyer : 1.84m x 0.95m\r\n\r\nHallway : 1.84m x 4.68m\r\n\r\nStudy/Office : 2.45m x 2.93m\r\n\r\nLiving Room : 3.60m x 4.63m\r\n\r\nDining Area : 3.60m x 3.12m\r\n\r\nKitchen : 4.39m x 3.02m\r\n\r\nLaundry Room : 2.45m x 2.70m\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C. : 1.24m x 1.07m\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom : 4.56m x 2.59m \r\n\r\nDressing Room : 2.46m x 2.46m \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.84m x 3.94m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.83m x 3.71m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 : 2.44m x 3.01m\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom : 2.00m x 1.70m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "West-facing private rear garden\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained 4 bedroom property\r\n\r\nMature residential location on the coast\r\n\r\nShort stroll to Malahide Village\r\n\r\nDual aspect living/dining room\r\n\r\nModern fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\n\r\nConvenient location close to local amenities and transport links\r\n\r\nTriple-glazed windows installed in 2024\r\n\r\nNew double-glazed rear patio door installed in 2024\r\n\r\nOriginal Junkers solid wood flooring in the hall and living room — can be sanded and re-varnished\r\n\r\nFull electrical rewire completed circa 2000\r\n\r\nKitchen fully rewired with a separate fuse board\r\n\r\nWater tank replaced\r\n\r\nAttic insulation installed, with part of the attic floored for storage\r\n\r\nRoof upgraded in 2025\r\n\r\nInterior fully repainted in 2024\r\n\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes in three rooms\r\n\r\nInternal wall insulation to the north-facing upstairs wall and kitchen, completed circa 2010\r\n\r\nExternal electrical points in the shed, with fittings suitable for external use\r\n\r\nNeff/Bosch/Siemens appliances included\r\n\r\nCurtains, carpets and blinds included in the sale"
      },
